[statement]
The packages a change frees are removed depth first: `l1`, then `l3`,
which `l1` alone needed, then `l2`.

[repository]
P:app
V:2

[installed]
P:l3
V:1

P:l2
V:1

P:l1
V:1
D:l3

P:app
V:1
D:l1 l2

[world]
app

[request]
app>=2

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
upgrade app 1 2
remove l1 1
remove l3 1
remove l2 1
